  { icon: '🍷', title: 'Wine Culture', text: 'South Africa is a world-class wine region and Cape Town is its capital. Wine tastings at estates cost ZAR 80–150 for 5–6 wines. Pinotage is the uniquely South African grape — try it everywhere. Wine is extremely affordable by international standards.' },
